<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Limitations ‣ Pre-Storage Reasoning for Episodic Memory: Shifting Inference Burden to Memory for Personalized Dialogue" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Lack of original conversation context</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Limitations ‣ Pre-Storage Reasoning for Episodic Memory: Shifting Inference Burden to Memory for Personalized Dialogue" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Absence of memory decay mechanisms</span></a></li>
