<span id="A1.F5.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A1.F5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Based on the context, write an answer in the form of a short phrase for the following question. Answer with exact words from the context whenever possible.
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Context:
<br class="ltx_break">{{$context}}
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Question: {{$question}}
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Short Answer:</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
